      "then": "access_token (string), issued_token_type (URI string), token_type (string, e.g. Bearer or N_A), and the optional expires_in (integer), scope (string), and refresh_token (string) are extracted; token_type=N_A is accepted without error",
      "references": [
        "RFC 8693 §2.2",
        "RFC 8693 §2.2.1"
